What I have figured out that the user has to select the appropriate ramp_de=
lay =

for the given board, on my board:
MCLK =3D 38.4MHz and RAMP_DELAY =3D 2 (109/81/55 ms) works best (meaning 55=
ms ramp =

delay), if it is shorter, than it clicks, if it is longer, than it does not =

click, but the beep tone can be observed.

